      "originalText": "Entities\n\nUserSession\n\nRefreshToken\n\nDevice/Client\n\nRevocationList\n\nAuditLog\n\nAPIs\n\nCreateSession(user_id, device_info, attributes) -> token, refresh_token\n\nValidateSession(token) -> bool, error\n\nRefreshSession(refresh_token) -> token\n\nRevokeSession(jti)\nRevokeSessions(user_id)\n\nGetActiveSessions(user_id)\n\nLogSessionEvent(event_type, jti, details)\n\n\n\n\n\n",
